<div class="index-div">
  <h2>About Veylora Access</h2>
  <p>Veylora Access is a platform that provides a unified identity and access management solution for company devices. It allows users to securely access Microsoft services and manage their devices with ease.</p>
  <p>The platform is currently in development, and we are working on implementing features such as identity provisioning, device enrollment, Windows sign-in integration, and access management.</p>
  <p>Stay tuned for updates as we continue to enhance the platform and provide a seamless experience for our users.</p>
</div>

